WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.910
Big news!

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:05.450
The manager, Ooshige-san, moved near Mitsuki.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.530
We helped her out with Dr. Wakaouji, but...

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.380
...the housekeeper, Tanaka-san, found us there.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:15.140
However, Tanaka-san thought that Ooshige-san was the doctor's fiancée...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.640
...and didn't suspect anything about Mitsuki's relationship with her...

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.990
That's rather convenient...

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.090
Do you understand?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.730
Yes.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.760
I've gathered everyone here today...

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.490
...to discuss <i>Full Moon</i>'s second single and to see what kind of ideas you all have.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.030
Yes.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.070
Thanks to all of you, <i>Myself</i>  was a huge success.

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:08.470
So, we're counting on you guys this time.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:12.710
We left everything up to Takasu-kun last time...

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:16.910
This time, we'd like all you guys to give us your input as well.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.470
Is that so...

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.340
In that case, you want something  innovative, right?

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.130
Innovative, huh...

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.320
Hey.

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:25.610
Yes.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.720
Well, what should we do?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.090
We don't want <i>Full Moon</i>  to be too limited in scope.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.490
I'll leave the rest up to you, then.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.490
It's really hard to come up with something totally new...

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.220
Um...

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.750
Couldn't we try asking <i>Full Moon</i>  herself?

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.210
That girl...

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:05.860
Every now and then, she comes up with ideas that we'd never think of.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:06.760
Besides...

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.090
...just what kind of message does she want her song to say...?

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.720
Even if she only tells us how she feels about it...

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.620
...it would at least give us some hint.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:15.960
I see.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.220
You're right.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.260
Nothing will happen if we just 
continue on like this...

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.310
Indeed.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.900
Then, we'll wait 'till next time 
to come to a conclusion!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:26.910
Eh?!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.150
Me?

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.200
Yep.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:33.000
We decided that we should 
find out your opinion, too.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.250
I see.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.160
I'm getting kinda excited now!

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:41.080
Looks like it's finally <i>my</i>  turn.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.750
Leave it to me!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.250
Then, we must immediately...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.680
Well...

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.220
...that's business as usual.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.550
So, what do you think?

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.360
Eh?

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.090
What do I think?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.810
Do you have any ideas, or is there anything that you want?

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.150
Since you're asking me so suddenly, I'm not really sure...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.160
You don't have to think so hard about it.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.900
Let's brainstorm together before the next meeting.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:09.440
Eh?

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.940
I'm going too?

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.200
Ah, that's right.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.410
That way, we can find a song that will get you closer to Eichi-kun, right?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.080
Ah, I see...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.480
You're right.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.980
That one, this one, always 
going on and on about Eichi.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:26.250
Takuto!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.590
How could you?!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.210
Crap!

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.500
Hold it right there!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.050
Ah!

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:32.380
Stop, Meroko!

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.090
No way!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:33.720
I won't forgive you!

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.520
How do you like this?

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.020
To get closer to Eichi-kun, huh...

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.100
Spare me!

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:41.770
Serves you right!

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.360
I wonder what I should do...

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.970
You don't need to think so much about it, do you?

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.320
Ah! I can't take it!

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.580
You're getting on my nerves!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.840
You want Eichi-kun to notice you, right?

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.080
In that case, you have to go...

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.890
"Eichi-kun! Eichi-kun!"

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.000
...and just keep on singing like that, right?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.160
Do people actually do that?!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:08.010
But, it's the fastest way to get his attention!

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.360
Like I said, that won't work!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.280
But...

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:13.820
Ooshige-san...

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.280
I've decided!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.910
Ah, you've decided?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.200
So, what kind of image do you want for the song?

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:19.820
No...

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:21.160
This is more important than the image...

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.790
There's a song I just have to sing.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.160
A song you have to sing?

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.040
Yes...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.510
But... I don't know the title of the song...

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.210
Huh?

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.770
Y-You know...

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:34.980
Well...

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.740
It goes something like...

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:57.770
Huh?

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.530
What song was that...

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:00.810
You know it?

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:01.700
Yeah...

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:02.900
But, Mitsuki...

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.370
Why do you want this song?

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.170
Well...

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.950
It's a memorable song for Eichi-kun and me...

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.840
It was back when we were little, though...

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.900
I sang this song with Eichi-kun a lot.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:14.960
So...

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.340
...if it's this song, Eichi-kun will recognize it.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:19.720
...and maybe he'll notice me...

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.080
I see.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:21.890
But...

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.600
Really, what was that song...

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:25.350
Hey.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.850
If it's a memory of Eichi-kun...

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:28.850
...can't you remember anything else about it?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:33.630
The only thing I can think of is that my father wrote it...

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.440
Huh?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:35.920
That's crazy!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.650
Then, of course we don't know the name of the song!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:42.590
But I've... definitely heard it before.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.630
Mitsuki's father wrote it when she was little...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.510
Hmm?

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:49.680
Wrote?

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.710
Mitsuki, he wrote it... What did your father do?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:54.660
Eh?

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.210
He died when I was one...

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.300
...so I don't know much about him.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.890
I think he was in a band.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:01.630
Eh?!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:02.260
Then...

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.950
...your father was a musician?!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.220
You didn't know that?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:10.140
So that means that it's a song by a band from about ten years ago, right?

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:10.980
I guess...

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.390
Ah, I remember!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.230
It's <i>Eternal Snow</i> !

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:18.070
Route L's mystical song!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.690
<i>Eternal Snow</i> ?

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:20.610
Yep.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.150
Only performed live...

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:26.640
It's a secret song that only fans know of!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.230
Which means that...

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.420
...y-your father... {shani: damn, ooshige is so cute!}

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.250
...was a member of Route L...

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.240
P-Probably...

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:39.880
Seriously?

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.590
S-Seriously.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.780
All right!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.720
I don't believe this!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.220
I'm on top of the world!

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.380
Oh no!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.890
This isn't the time for this.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.810
Looks like we decided on a plan.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:56.420
Now that we've figured things out...

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.110
...let's give it out all!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.160
Right, Mitsuki?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.170
S-Sure...

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.660
I see.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.660
<i>Eternal Snow</i>, huh?

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:08.120
Yes.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:09.780
I'm requesting you.

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.830
I just have to sing this song!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.960
How about it?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.080
Sounds good.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.540
I'll take it.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.840
If I remember correctly, that's the song by Route L, right?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:19.510
Yep.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.300
Okay.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.420
We'll have to get on it right away.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.550
Then...

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:27.140
...I'll go with <i>Full Moon</i>  to ask Takasu-san.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.270
Well, then, shall we get started?

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.100
Sure.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.290
I'll be heading out first.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.200
Yeah, it's Takashi.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.740
Ah, it's been a while.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.740
How are you doing?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.730
Geez, don't just ask me how I'm doing.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:50.240
You're always pretending to be nice, Takashi-san.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.750
You promised me that you'd make up for that audition...

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.210
It's been forever...

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.670
Eh, well...

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.330
Sorry about saying that...

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:00.670
Forgive me, Madoka-chan.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:03.960
I have so much to do at my new job.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.240
Well, it's pretty much decided.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.350
Eh, that's...

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.560
I'm working on the plans for 
<i>Full Moon's</i>  second single. {he justed busted it!}

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:18.180
Oh, is that so?

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:19.940
Yes.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:25.070
<i>Eternal Snow</i>  with Takasu-san?

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.970
Well, I'll take you out next time, Madoka-chan...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.620
Talk to you later, then.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:33.770
'kay, 'kay...

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.550
Madoka!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:42.590
You've been waiting?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.210
Hey...

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.890
That last commercial... it's doing great.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:47.300
We just had a meeting.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.590
Sasaki-san...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.870
After this commercial was over with...

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.980
...you said I'd get to sing next, right?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.990
Yeah I did, but...

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.020
You see...

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:02.450
...there's a song that I just have to sing.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.290
Good morning!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.330
Ooshige-san!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.040
All right!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.250
I'm done!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:18.910
Come on!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.210
Now I just have to take this to Takasu-san and ask him!

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.590
Mitsuki, look!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.800
It's the perfect plan!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.110
Ooshige-san, you didn't...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.110
Of course, I didn't sleep a wink!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.020
Amazing...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.760
A-Are you okay?

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:36.220
I'm just peach.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:36.640
Come on!

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.600
Let's hurry over to Takasu-san's place!

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:39.270
Okay.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.520
With this...

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.720
...you'll be closer to reaching Eichi-kun.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.820
Thinking about Eichi-kun this early in the morning?

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:45.940
He! He!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.800
With a smile!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.500
It's morning! It's morning! {alpha}

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.680
It's morning! It's morning! {alpha}

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:54.370
Is she really okay?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.340
Takasu-san's late.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.980
He said that something urgent came up.

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:06.460
Oh well, can't do anything about that.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:07.790
He's popular...

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.570
Hey, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:12.430
Sorry about that.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.780
A meeting suddenly came up.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:17.990
So...

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.400
...you brought the plans 
for the second single today?

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.230
Yes.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.380
The details are in this copy.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.690
Let's see...

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.820
No good...

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:40.030
Sorry, but... I can't do this. {shani: takasu hates eternal snow?!}

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:40.580
Eh?!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:41.910
Why's that?!

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:43.290
Is there a problem somewhere?

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.320
No.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.960
Actually, by chance...

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:49.420
...I just received the exact same plan earlier.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:53.920
I was late today because of 
a meeting concerning it...

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:54.510
This time...

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.550
...a girl named Wakamatsu Madoka...

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.410
...will be debuting with <i>Eternal Snow</i>.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.970
I know it's sudden.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.630
Sorry, but this won't work. {shani: mistuki is saddened T_T}

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:16.080
Could you think of a different song for the second single?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.510
That can't be...

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.120
Wakamatsu-san...

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:23.200
This time, you're going to be debuting as a singer with a song by Route L, right?

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.000
Yes.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.920
It's a song I've always loved...{ugh}

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.430
I'm really happy.

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:30.200
And the producer will be Takasu-san?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:30.940
Yes.

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:34.290
He'll be giving me his full support this time.

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.430
I'm so grateful.

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:38.720
Ah...

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.190
After I did all that work on the plan...

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.560
Does this kind of thing just happen coincidentally?

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.440
Coincidence?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.130
There's no way!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.770
It's her... Wakamatsu Madoka...

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:50.060
There's something fishy about this!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.150
But you know...

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:53.260
No one knew about that besides us.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.990
How would this have gotten out?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.360
T-That's...

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.110
There must have been a spy or something...

00:14:58.110 --> 00:14:59.250
Huh?

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.830
Have you been watching too much television?

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:02.590
That's right.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:06.360
Besides, there's no way that 
information could have gotten out.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.210
But...!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.170
There's definitely something fishy about that girl!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.210
Look here...

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.090
Ooshige-san...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.860
...so I can't sing <i>Eternal Snow</i>  now?

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.880
Mitsuki...

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.010
Don't worry.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.680
Rest assured...

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.190
I'll make sure you get to sing it.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.520
Really?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.380
Yep.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.610
We'll go back to Seed Record tomorrow...

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.070
...and try asking other producers.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.900
This means we'll be going against Wakamatsu Madoka...

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.900
A battle through <i>Eternal Snow</i> !

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.660
Until next week...

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.510
Excuse us.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:51.730
Takasu-san...

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.540
What is it?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:54.510
I...

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.600
...will do whatever to make <i>Eternal Snow</i>  sell.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.220
So...

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.470
What's wrong now?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.120
I don't want to lose...

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.470
...to <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.690
<i>Full Moon</i>, huh?

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.790
Hey.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.230
Aren't you keeping something from me?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.400
Actually... <i>Full Moon</i>  also...

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.320
...asked for the same thing.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:24.560
She wanted <i>Eternal Snow</i>  to be her second single...

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.100
Isn't that odd?

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.510
Ah...

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.370
Yes...

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.100
What an amazing coincidence!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:36.980
You...

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.010
You're hiding something.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:40.830
This...

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.320
...was really <i>Full Moon's</i>  plan, wasn't it?

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.650
And even though you knew about this...

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.890
...you asked me to do this job...

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.790
...just to beat <i>Full Moon.</i>

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:51.830
Am I wrong?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.690
I don't like her.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.700
Without having to work hard at all...

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.950
...a newcomer can suddenly rise to the top.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.550
I don't like it.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.450
Well...

00:17:07.450 --> 00:17:10.600
...whichever one of you was first has nothing to do with me.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:14.830
I just do the job exactly as I've been told.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.730
It's just...

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.650
People who don't have faith in my abilities...

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.260
I don't want to waste myself on them.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:24.530
That's all.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:26.750
Takasu-san.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.120
I only have one goal in mind.

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.350
I don't want to lose to <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.770
<i>Full Moon...</i>

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.310
Please help me defeat her.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.590
All right, that's fine.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.280
Okay...

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.870
You really want to beat her, huh?

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:44.760
Yes.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.950
Then cut out the acting already.

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:49.790
Take her on as your true self.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:50.660
Yes.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.980
I'll take your talent...

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:55.470
...and I'll make you shine.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.080
That should do it.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.320
All that's left is to go and 
ask every single one of them.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.410
Ooshige-san.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.970
Thank you so much!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:19.950
It's nothing.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.980
A manager and her talent are like two people in a three-legged race.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:23.640
Besides...

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:26.160
...the mystical Route L song...

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.690
The leader's daughter, Mitsuki should be the one to sing it.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.200
That's a given.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.300
Ooshige-san.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:35.540
What kind of person was my father?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.740
Let's see...

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:40.240
His technique with the guitar was good...

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:44.090
Basically, he was a person 
who wrote wonderful songs.

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:47.810
He and the keyboardist, Dr. Wakaouji, had tones that complemented each other perfectly.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:51.010
Listening to their sounds as the song began...

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.560
That was bliss.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:54.860
Speaking of which...

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.310
The girl who sang for them...

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:58.150
I wonder what she's doing now. {she's in heaven, watching her daughter succeed, or something like that}

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:59.060
Anyways...

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:02.840
...she was a vocal genius, 
as good as you currently are.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.850
Ah... why did they break up... {you're managing that reason}

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.610
Hey, if they're so famous...

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:10.490
...shouldn't there be some videos of your father still around?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.580
There aren't any.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:13.200
Eh?!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.440
Why?

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.750
They were a band who hated appearing on television and such.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.790
"We'll go with out natural sound!"

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.540
...was the policy that they went by.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:23.170
It was really cool.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.710
Well, maybe that's why Route L 
is such a legendary band.

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.260
So that's how it is...

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.490
Route L, huh?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:33.890
Geez...

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:36.960
You've been going "Mmm... mmm..." for a while now... it's so annoying.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.790
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.200
Well, shall we get going?

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.040
Okay!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:47.530
Well, I understand how you feel...

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.660
...but I'm no match for Takasu-san.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.510
Can't you go find someone else?

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.440
Ah!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.790
That's an interesting story! {inb4 cool story bro}

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.090
Will you do it then?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:01.010
Ah, I'd love to if I had the time...

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.590
I'm really busy right now...

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:03.770
Sorry!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.110
I won't do it.{if I were you. :D}

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.220
Please, we're begging you!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.080
Even if you say that...

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.430
Then... who will?

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.260
It won't work.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.180
Anyone who tried would be completely crushed.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.680
I'm not trying to be mean. {I am just a sore loser. :D}

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:19.370
Give it up. 'kay?

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.710
No one else will do it either...

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:25.780
All right!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.620
In that case, let's give it up here 
and try a foreign one!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:29.410
Eh?!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.910
Ooshige-san, you speak English?!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.100
{unsubbed for lulz, it's in english} {Takasu is feared worldwide}

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:45.190
Isn't this comfy, Takuto?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:48.680
Huh?

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.670
How'd it go?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.370
No good...

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.390
I guess we're no match for Takasu-san.

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:56.950
Is that so...

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:01.890
If only Mitsuki's father was alive...

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:05.350
He'd get it taken care of in a jiffy. {shani: meroko came up with an ii idea!!}

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:05.950
Ah!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.960
That's it!

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:07.690
Huh?

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:08.240
Hey.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.620
Even if your old man's gone...

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.930
...you still have someone who's practically a father to you!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:12.910
Ah!

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.500
Like a father?

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.660
You know!

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:18.600
The one who used to play in the same band!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.530
A cold?

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:07.060
Ah...

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:08.980
I can't take this anymore!

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:09.490
Hmm?

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:10.440
What's wrong, Meroko?

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:12.570
About the producer of her new single...

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.030
They've asked Dr. Wakaouji to do it, but...

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:17.080
...he won't do it at all!

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:19.370
Instead, he continuously goes "Mitsuki! Mitsuki!" and how it might be a problem...

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.280
...and just keeps on mumbling.

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:22.330
That doctor...

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:25.120
He said he had already quit music before, didn't he?

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:27.550
Wouldn't that have something to do with his reason why?

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.840
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:31.800
A Request to Dr. Wakaouji
